":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CoreNumbers","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Cliques11CoreNumbersV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The core decomposition of the simple graph underlying this one (self-loops ignored,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parallel edges counted once), by Batagelj–Zaversnik’s bucket algorithm. O(n + m)."}],"role":"symbol"}}}